    {
      "id": "18",
      "description": "6.2 Run clean warning-enabled builds plus isolated ASan/UBSan scenarios and Valgrind where available; inspect `/proc` fd/process-group/RSS stability through repeated interactions. Verify no new invalid access, unbounded preview growth, accumulated unreaped direct children while running, idle polling or preview allocations without `-P`. Verify cooperative groups terminate within the separate 2000 ms observation window after SIGKILL, without blocking menu exit or asserting instantaneous disappearance/containment of intentional escapees. Disclose tool/platform gaps and pre-existing defects.",
      "done": false,
